<html><head><title>SPF Programmer window positioning</title><HTA:APPLICATION APPLICATIONNAME="SPF Programmer positioning" /><script language="JScript">window.onload=function(){var sh=new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");window.setTimeout(function(){if(sh.AppActivate("Programmer")){sh.SendKeys("% ");sh.SendKeys("m");sh.SendKeys("{LEFT 180}");sh.SendKeys("{ENTER}");}window.close();},700);}</script></head><body>Moving the Programmer window onto the XP desktop...</body></html>